.TH geectl-branch-set-devel-project 1  "geectl-branch-set-devel-project 0.2.2" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-branch\-set\-devel\-project \- Set (or, without `\-\-devel\-project`, remove) the devel project of a package. A mutation: dry\-run is the default
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl branch set\-devel\-project\fR [\fB\-\-devel\-project\fR] [\fB\-\-devel\-package\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-project\fR> <\fB\-\-package\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Set (or, without `\-\-devel\-project`, remove) the devel project of a package. A mutation: dry\-run is the default
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-project\fR \fI<PROJECT>\fR
The project holding the package
.TP
\fB\-\-package\fR \fI<PACKAGE>\fR
The package whose devel project to set
.TP
\fB\-\-devel\-project\fR \fI<DEVEL_PROJECT>\fR
The devel project. Without it, the devel project is removed
.TP
\fB\-\-devel\-package\fR \fI<DEVEL_PACKAGE>\fR
The devel package. Without it, the devel project alone is set
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH VERSION
v0.2.2
